 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Your city is out of flat land, so you build on a steep hill. Problem solved!",
   "pausa": 0.3
  },
  {
   "texto": "To make room, you cut the hill straight down behind the house.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  },
  {
   "texto": "But a summer storm soaks the hill, and the wet slope slides.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  },
  {
   "texto": "So you build a heavy wall at the foot of the cut.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  },
  {
   "texto": "But rain still soaks in behind it, and the water pushes the wall over.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  },
  {
   "texto": "So you add gravel and drain holes, so the water can get out.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  },
  {
   "texto": "Or you use wire baskets full of rocks. Heavy, and water flows right through.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  },
  {
   "texto": "And you plant the slope, so roots hold the dirt together.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  },
  {
   "texto": "Congratulations! You just made a hillside safer. What should we build next?",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
